# Testimony Of Glory (Q220), last part: a level 38 Orc Raider at cond 10 holding the scepter of Tantos and Tanapi's order is told by Kakai to bring the scepter to Tanapi, trades it for
# the ritual box, relogs, and Kakai gives the Mark of Glory and, once the quest is over, says so. Every script roll is pinned to 1.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
